  "description": "The Ranger ST 2.0 All-Terrain Fat Tire eBike is built for riders who want comfort, power, and versatility in one bike. Its step-through frame makes getting on and off easier, while the wide saddle and balanced riding position help keep you comfortable whether you're commuting across town, running errands, or heading out for a longer weekend ride.\nA peak 1800W motor provides strong, responsive power for quick starts, hills, and changing road conditions. Paired with a 48V 13Ah battery, the Ranger ST 2.0 delivers up to 75 miles of pedal-assist range, giving you plenty of room for daily rides and longer trips without constantly thinking about the next charge.\nThe 26\" x 4.0\" fat tires add grip and stability as the surface changes. Built for pavement, gravel roads, packed dirt, grass, and other mixed everyday surfaces, they help keep the ride steady and controlled. Shimano 7-speed gearing lets you adjust your effort as the road changes, while the front suspension fork helps smooth out bumps and uneven surfaces for a more comfortable ride. Responsive disc brakes provide dependable control when it's time to slow down.\nFrom weekday commutes to relaxed weekend rides, the Ranger ST 2.0 gives you the flexibility to ride comfortably across everyday mixed terrain, with the power and practical features to make more of every trip.",
